ract with them and have them accompany you while doing your tasks. Discover secret stories and encounter friendly ghosts.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the best possible home for your new friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover different rooms</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock different rooms with different sets of items, and discover unique locations like the Black Forest and many more. They all have different stories to uncover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697380/extras/566e6ac44b8d52043dc83c299d61b498.avif?t=1751281829\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p>",
